sqlite-web pulls transitive Python dependencies (peewee, flask and their
own dependencies) resolved by pip at build time; each carries its own
license. Run `pip freeze` inside the image for the resolved set.

The base image is python:3.14-alpine3.22, which contains CPython
(PSF-2.0) on Alpine Linux. Alpine's packages carry their own licenses
(musl MIT, busybox GPL-2.0-only); source is published at
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports.
